                  "text": "Joel 2:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amukumbile imvula kuli-Jehova ciindi camvula iisyaalila. Amukumbile kuli-Jehova uucita lulabo, uuabila bantu incabwacabwa yakukuzizya boonse micelo yamumyuunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
