                "loc": "MRK.6.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 6:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo zikozyano zyamizimu zilaamba zintu zyabuyo, azilengano nzibabona basondi nzyakubeja. Basikulota balaamba makani aatakwe milimo, amajwi aabo aakuumbulizya taagwasyi. Nciceeco bantu ncibaleela mbuli imbelele. Balasoweka nkaambo kakubula mweembeli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
